WEBVTT

00:00:26.919 --> 00:00:31.160
Have you been horribly injured by a
product made by the Acme Corporation?

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.520
It's not your fault. There's probably
someone to blame.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.500
The name of the case is Coyote versus
Acme.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:45.400
Wily Coyote. He is reckless. We all

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.940
know who's responsible and all of his
injuries are self-inflicted.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:57.180
You've been settling Acme cases for years.
I could probably get you 250 bucks for

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:00.620
that. This is your opportunity to really
show people what you're capable of.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.460
These companies think they can do whatever
they want.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.640
We're sick of it. Acme, Acme! Nothing to
see here.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:13.840
We really have nothing. We both

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:18.500
know it would be very unpleasant if
anything bigger were to

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.080
become public.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:39.460
So, uh, what is up, Doc? The

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:42.480
Acme Corporation is releasing this film
for account purposes only.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.300
We do not condone any of the storylines depicted.
